      "writtenOn": "2025-01-24T06:38:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`FROMLIST` is a hint that a good faith effort is going into getting this merged.  For patches that are explicitly rejected from upstream, that doesn\u0027t make sense anymore and so that tag should not be used, and instead, they are obviously \"ANDROID-ONLY\" things.\n\nThis isn\u0027t the first time this has come up recently, some other patch series were attempted to be submitted here that left off the fact that the `FROMLIST` patches were rejected by upstream years ago.  Don\u0027t make us have to dig through all links to verify the upstream status of this type of thing, make it easy please for reviewers, that is our limited resource.",
      "parentUuid": "c981b1ca_e4d5558a",
      "revId": "3bed176e44a70c84a241388386a41e328488e180",
